#: lib/tuist_web/marketing/controllers/marketing_html/about.html.heex:122
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "We embrace standards for long-term success while respecting freedom of choice."
msgstr "우리는 선택의 자유를 존중하며 장기적 성공을 위한 표준을 수용합니다."

#: lib/tuist_web/marketing/controllers/marketing_controller.ex:1055
#: lib/tuist_web/marketing/controllers/marketing_html/pricing.html.heex:670
